WEBVTT

00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:30.793
The company started as a single
coworking space in Soho,

00:01:30.817 --> 00:01:33.020
and in just a few years, WeWork exploded

00:01:33.044 --> 00:01:35.824
to more than 100 cities
in dozens of countries,

00:01:35.848 --> 00:01:38.371
employing more than 12,000 people.

00:01:38.395 --> 00:01:40.062
They weren't just selling leases,

00:01:40.086 --> 00:01:42.401
they were selling a new vision for work.

00:01:42.425 --> 00:01:44.238
And Dave Fano was on board.

00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:49.624
DF: For me it meant making
going to work awesome for people.

00:01:49.648 --> 00:01:53.332
You know, with an initial focus
on the physical environment,

00:01:53.356 --> 00:01:56.510
and making that environment comfortable

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.688
and exciting and feeling good,

00:01:58.712 --> 00:02:02.069
and then also the technological side
of how we brought people together,